# 8. Source Code Management

The application source code was stored in Git.

The general workflow was:

```text
Developer
   |
   ↓
Git Repository
   |
   ↓
Jenkins
```

Jenkins was configured with access to the Git repository.

The pipeline performs a checkout operation similar to:

```groovy
checkout scm
```

or:

```groovy
git branch: 'main',
    url: 'REPOSITORY_URL'
```

The purpose is to ensure Jenkins always works with the latest source code from the selected branch.

